/Write a MARIE program using indirect addressing (LoadI) to load 
/characters one-by-one into the accumulator (AC) and display them. 
/Stop the program when you get the character dot ‘.’ (ASCII value 02E).
/Convert above MARIE program to a subroutine.
/main
Jns stringOut
Halt
/subroutine
stringOut,  Hex 0
Loop,       LoadI myAdd
            Subt Dot
            Skipcond 400    /如果等于0，就跳过下一行
            Jump beginOut
            JumpI stringOut
beginOut,   LoadI myAdd
            Output
            Load myAdd
            Add One
            Store myAdd
            Jump Loop

One,      HEX 1
myAdd,    ADR myName
myName,   HEX 053   / S
          HEX 075   / u
          HEX 066   / f
          HEX 065   / e
          HEX 069   / i
Space,    HEX 020   / space
          HEX 057   / W
          HEX 061   / a
          HEX 06E   / n
          HEX 00A   / new line
          HEX 033   / 3
          HEX 036   / 6
          HEX 038   / 8
          HEX 038   / 8
          HEX 036   / 6
          HEX 035   / 5
          HEX 038   / 8
          HEX 030   / 0
Dot,      HEX 02E   / '.'